  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component B provide support to the Asia-Africa Blue Tech Superhighway project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i) supporting data-based systems for effective management of small-scale fisheries; 
ii) promoting innovative integrated seawater farming; 
iii) developing and scaling innovative pro-poor technologies to reduce food loss and waste, and; 
iv) testing incentive-based marine and coastal ecosystem conservation. 
The project will harness transformative technologies and innovative approaches to tackle climate change&#x2019;s impacts in coastal areas on livelihoods and food security</narrative>
  </description>
